# Peragus, the asteroid's surface and the dormitories (TSL, 104PER and
# 105PER): across the scaffolding to Atton's comm and the Harbinger's
# arrival, then the dormitories: the shift console's lockdown ended and
# its ventilation shut, the holologs read at the log terminal, Coorta's
# body by the turbolift, and the code entered in reverse (7, 5, 13, 17, 3).
# Starts from the fuel depot's checkpoint:
#   kjk playthrough tsl @peragus_asteroid data/routes/tsl/peragus_dorms.route --god
# Walkthroughs: DSimpson's "Space... The Current Frontier", "The
# Dormitories", "Getting Out of the Dormitory Level"; GameBanshee's
# Asteroid Exterior and Dormitories (context/walkthroughs/tsl/).
to SionArrives       # across the platform to the window: Atton's comm, the
talk                 # Harbinger docking (Sion among the corpses)
exit To_105PER       # into the dormitories' airlock
fight 20             # the two droids past it
use MilLowPlstcCylin # its plasteel container
fight 25             # the droids and the cold turrets
# The shift console, DSimpson's way: [Repair] rerouted with a part, through
# the camera controls the east dormitory's ventilation shut with a spike
# [Computer], and the dormitories' lockdown ended (the door opens).
say Reroute the main console system
say Access remote camera controls
say Dormitory East
say Shut down the dormitory ventilation
say Return to main functions
say End dormitory emergency lockdown
say Log out
use ShiftConsole
talk
to WP_GASDEATH5      # into the east dormitory, its gas shut off
fight 25             # the droids in the dormitory halls
use Refresher        # the second room's refresher: the mine foreman's log
say insert mine foreman hololog # the log terminal: the foreman's entry,
say Much Trouble     # Sien on Coorta and the Exchange (a hololog), then
say =Log out.        # log out
use Mincon
talk                 # the terminal's menu
talk                 # Sien's hololog
talk                 # the menu again
# The turbolift terminal by Coorta's body. The code as the transmission
# gave it fails; the camera log shows Coorta's end (HK-50's droids) and
# that the code goes in reverse; entered so it opens (DSimpson).
pick 1,2,3,17,13,5,7,4 # open the door, enter the code manually: 3, 17, 13,
use TurboConsole     # 5, 7 (incorrect), log out
talk
pick 2               # the camera logs: Coorta and his crew at the door,
use TurboConsole     # HK-50's droids
talk
talk
pick 1,2,7,5,13,17,3,1,2 # the code in reverse: 7, 5, 13, 17, 3; log out
use TurboConsole
talk
exit Door_To_101PER  # the turbolift up to the administration level
save peragus_admin_again
